        "id": "FioraPassive",
        "name": "Duelist's Dance",
        "maxRank": 0,
        "summary": "Fiora has revealed a <keywordMajor>Vital</keywordMajor> on this Champion. If she hits the <keywordMajor>Vital</keywordMajor>, she <healing>restores Health</healing> and gains <speed>Move Speed</speed>.",
        "bodyHtml": "Fiora identifies <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Vitals</span> on enemy champions. Hitting this <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Vital</span> with an Attack or Ability deals an additional <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-500 font-semibold\">(3% + (0.04% bonus Attack Damage)) max Health true damage</span>, grants Fiora <span class=\"text-cyan-600 dark:text-cyan-500\">?% Move Speed</span> decaying over 2 seconds, and restores <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(35 ~ 100) Health</span>.<br /><br />Fiora reveals a new <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Vital</span> after 15 seconds or after striking one.",
