        "bodyHtml": "Fiora lunges in a direction and stabs the closest enemy, ward, or structure, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(70/80/90/100/110 + (90/95/100/105/110% bonus Attack Damage)) physical damage</span>. The strike will prioritize <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Vitals</span> and enemies it will kill.<br /><br />If Fiora strikes an enemy, this Ability's Cooldown is reduced by 50%.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The strike applies On-Hit Effects.</span>",
